==Strategy==
The main difference between this stage and the last is the increased magnification of the Riceball Cats, and the addition of THE SLOTH. The latter is not much of an issue as long as you don't push too far after the boss spawns. Aside from this, the strategy is very similar to [[Oh Yokozuna! (Expert)]].

Lure the enemies to the Cat Base and build up a sizeable stack of Midrange and Backline attackers such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cats]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cats]], as well as [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]]. Then, defend against the hoard of Riceball Cats to the best of your abilities, at least until it exhausts itself out.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Ancient Egg: N001 (Special Cat)|Haniwa Cat]]: Can help a lot in tanking the hits of the Riceball Cats and THE SLOTH, with its Resistance against Traitless.
*[[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]]: Takes a beating thanks to Survive, and reliably damages the horde of Riceball Cats from a good range.
*[[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]]: Great at nuking a large amount of Riceball Cats alongside Ururun Cat, though can occasionally miss due to the latter's Knockback ability.

